[recv] {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"commandExecution","id":"call_w9MjCKhueVANhBKzTZ9epUOs","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,180p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/pushbutton.md && sed -n '1,140p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/led.md && sed -n '1,120p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/crystal.md\"","cwd":"/workspace","processId":"71761","source":"unifiedExecStartup","status":"completed","commandActions":[{"type":"read","command":"sed -n '1,180p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/pushbutton.md","name":"pushbutton.md","path":"/root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/pushbutton.md"},{"type":"read","command":"sed -n '1,140p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/led.md","name":"led.md","path":"/root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/led.md"},{"type":"read","command":"sed -n '1,120p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/crystal.md","name":"crystal.md","path":"/root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/crystal.md"}],"aggregatedOutput":"# `<pushbutton />`\n\nPushbuttons a common type of switch normally open momentary switch. They are commonly used as a reset or pairing button.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nexport default () => (\n  <board width=\"10mm\" height=\"10mm\">\n    <pushbutton\n      name=\"SW1\"\n      footprint=\"pushbutton\"\n    />\n  </board>\n)\n```\n\n## Props\n\nCommonly used: `name`, `footprint`, `connections`\n\n## References\n\n- Props: [PushButtonProps](https://github.com/tscircuit/props#pushbuttonprops-pushbutton)\n- Source: [lib/components/push-button.ts](https://github.com/tscircuit/props/blob/main/lib/components/push-button.ts)\n- Local docs: [docs/docs/elements/pushbutton.mdx](../docs/docs/elements/pushbutton.mdx)\n# `<led />`\n\nLight emitting diodes are diodes that emit light when current passes through them. They are commonly used as indicators on a circuit board such as a \"power on indicator\" or \"data transfer in progress indicator\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nexport default () => (\n <board width=\"10mm\" height=\"10mm\">\n  <led name=\"LED1\" footprint=\"0603\" color=\"red\" />\n </board>\n)\n```\n\n## Props\n\nCommonly used: `color`, `wavelength`, `schDisplayValue`, `schOrientation`, `connections`, `laser`, `name`, `footprint`\n\n## References\n\n- Props: [LedProps](https://github.com/tscircuit/props#ledprops-led)\n- Source: [lib/components/led.ts](https://github.com/tscircuit/props/blob/main/lib/components/led.ts)\n- Local docs: [docs/docs/elements/led.mdx](../docs/docs/elements/led.mdx)\n# `<crystal />`\n\nA crystal oscillator provides a stable clock signal essential for timing applications and microcontroller operations.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nexport default () => (\n  <board width=\"50mm\" height=\"50mm\">\n    <crystal\n      name=\"XT1\"\n      frequency=\"16MHz\"\n      loadCapacitance=\"18pF\"\n      footprint=\"hc49\"\n    />\n  </board>\n)\n```\n\n## Props\n\nCommonly used: `frequency`, `loadCapacitance`, `manufacturerPartNumber`, `mpn`, `pinVariant`, `schOrientation`, `connections`, `name`\n\n## References\n\n- Props: [CrystalProps](https://github.com/tscircuit/props#crystalprops-crystal)\n- Source: [lib/components/crystal.ts](https://github.com/tscircuit/props/blob/main/lib/components/crystal.ts)\n- Local docs: [docs/docs/elements/crystal.mdx](../docs/docs/elements/crystal.mdx)\n","exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"019e8ead-3fd5-7af3-b65a-79c9bbea0956","turnId":"019e8ead-3fee-7b92-8527-f198eb42614b","completedAtMs":1780510235316}}
